description	"The Officer

Based on open mode's Commander Class. They lack the heavy weapons fielded by the elitetroopers, and as individual soldiers are inferior to them. However, they do have the ability to rally soldiers and come with some unique equiptment of their own.

^2Weaponry:
- Blaster Pistol (3)
- Blaster Rifle (3)
- 1 Frag Grenade
- 2 Sonic Detonators

^6Equipment: 
- Electrobinoculars
- Seeker Drone

^8Attributes:
- Heal (2)
- 2 Reinforcements (CTF: 10s Respawn)
- Assemble (1) - Respawns on characters with Rally
- Rally - Characters with Assemble spawn on you

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]

^2Strengths^7: Very Useful rallying abilities. Commanders can also rally one another. 
^1Weaknesses^7: Inferior as individual units."